{"strongs": "H7581", "word": "שְׁאָגָה", "translit": "she.a.gah", "root": "שאג", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "roaring", "definition": "שְׁאָגָה noun feminine roaring ; — 1. like lion, absolute ׳ שׁ Isa 5:29 (of invaders); of lion, construct שַׁאֲגַת Zech 11:3 ; Job 4:10 (figurative of wicked), suffix קוֺל שַׁאֲגָתוֺ Ezek 19:7 (figurative of conquering king). 2. human cry in distress, שַׁאֲגְתִי Ps 32:3 , ׳ דִּבְרֵי שׁ Ps 22:2 , שַׁאֲגֹתָ֑י Job 3:24 . שֹׁאָה see שׁוֺאָה below שׁוא .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8360')\">BDB8360</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7581')\">H7581</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8359')\">BDB8359</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8361')\">BDB8361</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁאָגָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>roaring</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> like lion, absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,29)\">Isa 5:29</ref> (of invaders); of lion, construct <bdbheb>שַׁאֲגַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,3)\">Zech 11:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 4:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,10)\">Job 4:10</ref> (figurative of wicked), suffix <bdbheb>קוֺל שַׁאֲגָתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,7)\">Ezek 19:7</ref> (figurative of conquering king). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> human cry in distress, <bdbheb>שַׁאֲגְתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 32:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,32,3)\">Ps 32:3</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דִּבְרֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,2)\">Ps 22:2</ref>, <bdbheb>שַׁאֲגֹתָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,24)\">Job 3:24</ref>. </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>שֹׁאָה</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>שׁוֺאָה</reflink></bdbheb> below <bdbheb>שׁוא</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 5:29", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Zech 11:3", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 11, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Job 4:10", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 4, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 19:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 19, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 32:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 32, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 22:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Job 3:24", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 3, "verse": 24}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["שְׁאָגָה", "׳", "שׁ", "שַׁאֲגַת", "קוֺל שַׁאֲגָתוֺ", "שַׁאֲגְתִי", "דִּבְרֵי שׁ", "שַׁאֲגֹתָ֑י", "שֹׁאָה", "שׁוֺאָה", "שׁוא"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB8360", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}